{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Piano Keyboard 是一款把學琴變成音樂遊戲的 App，特別適合從未接觸鋼琴的初學者。用家只需跟隨向下流動的發光音符點按琴鍵，即使不懂樂譜，也能在第一次練習就彈出完整樂曲。程式提供完整 88 鍵鍵盤與多點觸控，可演奏和絃與滑音，並內建 12 種樂器音色。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-241.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>跟隨音符遊戲化練琴</h2>\n<p>練習時可開啟等待模式，彈對琴鍵才繼續播放，並可把樂曲減速、逐段重練。內建計分、連擊與一至三星評價，每首樂曲後更有老師筆記，指出搶拍、拖拍或困難小節。支援匯入 MIDI 檔案、一鍵錄音與 AI 優化，亦可接上 USB 或藍牙 MIDI 鍵盤，以真實琴鍵遊玩。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-91-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-92-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-93-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-94-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-95-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-96-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Piano Keyboard – No Ads</li><li>應用類別：Music</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/piano-keyboard-no-ads/id6827881643?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T15:56:49.460252+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":348,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T15:41:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T21:18:00.828312+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T15:50:21.134351+00:00","content_hash":"3a4bc36e9377e083a82050c9d1afec9da684f1b39e2efcb0c3a3227b8f9f53d5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}